    <string name="displayInfoTitle">Display</string>
    <string name="displayInfoMessage"><![CDATA[
        <b>QGE (Qube Graphics Engine)</b> is the optimized built-in display wrapper, it receives and displays frames natively without latency.<br/><br/>
        <b>VNC (Virtual Network Computing)</b> is the balanced choice for running the app as a host. It starts QEMU\'s VNC server without opening a viewer inside the app, allowing you to connect from any external VNC client.
    ]]></string>
